flowchart TB
    classDef node fill:#edf2f7,stroke:#2d3748,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef ext fill:#fffaf0,stroke:#c05621,stroke-width:1px;

    subgraph Clients[Client Devices]
      Browser[Web Browser\nDesktop and Mobile]:::node
    end

    subgraph FrontendHost[Frontend Hosting]
      Frontend[Vite Build\nReact + TypeScript SPA]:::node
    end

    subgraph ApiHost[Application Server]
      API[ASP.NET Core Web API]:::node
      Static[Uploads Static Files]:::node
    end

    subgraph DataLayer[Data Layer]
      SQL[(SQL Server\nEF Core Managed Schema)]:::node
    end

    Payment[[SSLCommerz]]:::ext
    Notify[[Email/SMS Providers]]:::ext

    Browser -->|HTTPS| Frontend
    Frontend -->|REST/JSON over HTTPS| API
    API --> Static
    API -->|EF Core| SQL
    API -->|payment requests and callbacks| Payment
    API -->|OTP and notifications| Notify
